    <briefdescription>
<para>Utility functions for advanced string handling in tests. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>These utilities simplify advanced string operations commonly required during test development. They support tasks such as partial string matching, splitting long strings for improved readability, and related manipulations that enhance the clarity and effectiveness of test code.  </para>
    </detaileddescription>
